WEBVTT

00:37.746 --> 00:41.958
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE 2

01:13.239 --> 01:16.117
I was… a very special child.

01:57.033 --> 01:58.493
It is okay to kill.

01:59.702 --> 02:03.039
But always make sure… you're never caught.

02:03.998 --> 02:05.208
Why never get caught?

02:11.589 --> 02:14.008
A good son answers
his mother with a "yes."

02:15.135 --> 02:16.719
He doesn't need to ask why.

02:17.846 --> 02:19.389
That is not good manners,

02:20.390 --> 02:21.474
dearest Seung-jo.

02:24.644 --> 02:26.146
Yes.

02:26.229 --> 02:27.147
Yes, Mother.

02:38.199 --> 02:40.160
I just wanted
my mother's approval.

03:00.096 --> 03:02.223
I wanted someone to comfort me.

03:04.392 --> 03:06.227
Even if it was just one time.

03:24.871 --> 03:28.958
Although we can't determine exactly
why only he can partially transform,

03:29.876 --> 03:31.920
we can formulate a hypothesis.

03:33.046 --> 03:34.130
What would that be?

03:35.590 --> 03:38.718
Well, unlike all the other specimens
we've had so far,

03:39.469 --> 03:42.931
Seung-jo inherited his Najin
from his biological mother.

03:45.016 --> 03:45.975
As in

03:46.935 --> 03:47.936
Akiko?

03:48.019 --> 03:50.730
When he was a fetus
inside his mother's body,

03:50.813 --> 03:53.983
the Najin altered
his genetic makeup altogether.

03:54.817 --> 03:58.821
So we can conclude that the Najin
has evolved and mutated

03:59.405 --> 04:01.866
in ways that no one could have predicted.

04:04.702 --> 04:05.578
Like how Seishin…

04:08.581 --> 04:10.291
manipulated her own body

04:11.167 --> 04:13.044
so that she could offer

04:13.962 --> 04:15.838
protection to her daughter.

04:18.716 --> 04:20.343
You're saying the Najin has

04:21.970 --> 04:23.721
kept the maternal instincts

04:24.931 --> 04:26.599
of his mother Akiko.

04:28.518 --> 04:29.894
That is what I believe.

04:32.188 --> 04:33.982
How very interesting.

04:43.491 --> 04:45.201
That's when I realized

04:46.202 --> 04:48.204
that I was not a special person.

04:49.580 --> 04:50.707
I was only

04:52.292 --> 04:53.584
an experiment.

04:56.337 --> 04:59.132
Did your meeting
with Master Jang go well today?

05:00.133 --> 05:00.967
Yes.

05:02.468 --> 05:03.594
The meeting went well.

05:03.678 --> 05:04.971
Then it is time

05:05.680 --> 05:08.433
to put all of your focus
on the next plan of ours,

05:09.392 --> 05:10.351
dear Seung-jo.

07:19.188 --> 07:20.189
You feeling okay?

07:24.485 --> 07:25.403
How'd you sleep?

07:30.825 --> 07:31.659
What's wrong?

07:32.618 --> 07:33.661
Are you in pain?

07:35.371 --> 07:36.831
Am I dreaming?

07:40.710 --> 07:42.378
If so, I hope I never wake.

08:08.321 --> 08:09.739
How I've missed you.

08:13.367 --> 08:16.329
I've missed you so much
that no matter how many times

08:16.829 --> 08:18.623
I would say it to myself…

08:21.083 --> 08:22.752
it was still never enough.

08:49.028 --> 08:51.155
What happened? Where's number 71?

08:51.822 --> 08:53.074
We haven't found him yet.

09:01.332 --> 09:02.792
It was you, wasn't it?

09:06.379 --> 09:07.964
What are you planning here exactly?

09:09.966 --> 09:11.300
I set him free.

09:12.134 --> 09:13.219
That's all.

09:14.887 --> 09:18.975
You know very well that letting him go
would only create chaos and wreak havoc.

09:19.934 --> 09:21.310
Well, it's still…

09:23.980 --> 09:26.190
more interesting
than the plan you're betting on.

09:26.983 --> 09:28.234
And what plan is that?

09:28.985 --> 09:30.111
I don't have to say.

09:33.698 --> 09:35.366
Just know I know what it is.

09:57.805 --> 09:59.640
I'm so hungry.

10:28.878 --> 10:31.505
Goodness, he's toppling over.

10:31.589 --> 10:33.424
How much did this guy have to drink?

10:36.093 --> 10:37.261
Excuse me, sir.

10:37.762 --> 10:39.305
I'm so hungry.

10:48.564 --> 10:49.815
Something's come up.

11:06.457 --> 11:10.378
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN LIFE AND DEATH

11:10.461 --> 11:14.382
EPISODE 6
BAIT

11:24.934 --> 11:27.687
Did you give the order
to go after Master Jang?

11:27.770 --> 11:30.147
Oh boy,
that's not what happened, all right?

11:30.231 --> 11:32.650
You're in charge of the detectives,
are you not, Captain?

11:32.733 --> 11:34.026
That means that it was you.

11:34.110 --> 11:35.403
I had no choice.

11:35.945 --> 11:37.697
I got six murder cases piling up on me.

11:37.780 --> 11:40.866
With Ho-jae leaving evidence
all over the crime scene, it's suspicious.

11:40.950 --> 11:43.077
How dare you pursue Master Jang.

11:43.160 --> 11:46.122
The House of Golden Treasure
did so much for your family.

11:46.205 --> 11:49.417
The reason you're sitting there is because
of what he did for your grandparents.

11:51.544 --> 11:55.047
You call this justice? You are all
going after the wrong person here.

11:57.717 --> 11:59.218
I need your help with something.

12:00.094 --> 12:00.928
What?

12:01.721 --> 12:03.139
My grandson has…

12:03.973 --> 12:05.015
He has gone missing.

12:05.850 --> 12:06.767
He's missing?

12:06.851 --> 12:09.270
He went into a new hires training camp,

12:09.353 --> 12:11.897
and then he received ten million won,

12:11.981 --> 12:14.275
and now he won't answer when I call.

12:15.651 --> 12:19.488
I called his work, and they said
there wasn't a training camp there at all.

12:20.197 --> 12:21.323
Which company was it?

12:22.032 --> 12:23.576
It's called Jeonseung.

12:23.659 --> 12:26.662
SEONG JUN-MO (41 YEARS OLD)
RESEARCHER AT JEONSEUNG BIOTECH

12:26.746 --> 12:30.040
OH KI-HOON (29 YEARS OLD)
BODYGUARD AT JEONSEUNG BIOTECH

12:30.124 --> 12:34.295
AHN JONG-HYEOK
HIRED A MONTH AGO BY JEONSEUNG BIOTECH

12:39.091 --> 12:41.135
The common denominator is

12:42.928 --> 12:44.346
Jeonseung Biotech.

12:45.097 --> 12:46.599
Should I dig into it?

12:46.682 --> 12:47.725
You scared me.

12:48.225 --> 12:49.810
Don't sneak up on me like that.

12:49.894 --> 12:50.936
A question.

12:51.520 --> 12:53.105
Did you meet the lady from yesterday?

12:59.153 --> 13:00.613
How do you know each other?

13:00.696 --> 13:02.865
She seemed pretty close
to Jang Ho-jae too.

13:02.948 --> 13:06.160
- Detective Park, let's eat.
- Should I order from Grandma's Gukbap?

13:06.744 --> 13:07.578
Want something?

13:07.661 --> 13:10.581
It's all strange
and has been from the get-go.

13:11.332 --> 13:14.084
I'm sure Jang Ho-jae
is super competent and all that,

13:14.168 --> 13:17.755
but ordering him to go find evidence
about the suspect like it was nothing?

13:17.838 --> 13:20.716
And then having me follow him,
and then you were…

13:20.800 --> 13:23.928
you were at the ICU to keep an eye
on Mr. Kwon all night. Why is that?

13:24.011 --> 13:24.929
You want food or what?

13:25.012 --> 13:27.223
So all you guys have known each other
for a while now.

13:27.306 --> 13:28.516
I'll order yours, then.

13:30.309 --> 13:31.852
Huh?

13:33.395 --> 13:35.648
Yes, this is Captain Yuh,
Violent Crimes Unit.

13:36.941 --> 13:38.150
Huh?

13:40.694 --> 13:41.529
Um, Captain?

13:44.448 --> 13:46.450
An indiscriminate act
of murder occurred

13:46.534 --> 13:48.702
on a subway station platform in Seoul.

13:48.786 --> 13:51.288
Three civilians died,
and one victim was rushed

13:51.372 --> 13:53.999
to the emergency room
after falling into critical condition.

13:54.083 --> 13:57.419
An emergency report was sent out around
5:00 a.m. saying a man in his twenties…

14:04.426 --> 14:06.220
According
to eyewitness accounts,

14:06.303 --> 14:07.137
the suspect attacked…

14:07.221 --> 14:09.181
- It can't be…
- …his first victim of three,

14:09.265 --> 14:12.726
a transportation department employee who
was preparing for the day's operations.

14:12.810 --> 14:13.727
I know that guy.

14:15.729 --> 14:18.315
- After the first attack…
- He was a test subject at Jeonseung.

14:18.399 --> 14:19.650
…the platform to attack…

14:19.733 --> 14:20.568
Is that true?

14:20.651 --> 14:21.485
Yeah.

14:22.236 --> 14:24.154
He escaped this morning from his cell.

14:24.238 --> 14:26.448
Another male in his forties
has reportedly been rushed…

14:26.532 --> 14:27.783
I did it.

14:27.867 --> 14:29.410
…receiving urgent treatment.

14:29.493 --> 14:31.078
I was the one who let him go.

14:31.161 --> 14:33.247
…the suspect was arrested
by the police while…

14:33.330 --> 14:35.124
Why would you do something like that?

14:35.708 --> 14:37.835
According to the police,
the motive of the crime…

14:37.918 --> 14:39.211
To show the world.

14:40.129 --> 14:41.297
They'll begin investigations…

14:41.380 --> 14:43.090
If you want people to believe something,

14:43.173 --> 14:45.384
you have to let them see it
with their own eyes.

14:46.677 --> 14:47.845
Otherwise, it's just rumors.

14:47.928 --> 14:49.930
Three people died because of you.

14:50.014 --> 14:52.182
And even more people
could die very soon, all right?

14:53.309 --> 14:54.268
Get it?

14:55.185 --> 14:56.270
What do you mean by that?

14:58.022 --> 15:00.441
What do you mean
that even more people could die very soon?

15:02.401 --> 15:03.944
All I know is…

15:05.446 --> 15:06.947
…Lady Maeda is up to no good.

15:08.699 --> 15:11.035
I don't know the details,
but it's dangerous.

15:11.118 --> 15:13.662
ASSAILANT ATTACKS
STATION EMPLOYEE INDISCRIMINATELY

15:14.163 --> 15:16.248
CHAOS STRIKES MORNING COMMUTE
6 VICTIMS

15:16.332 --> 15:17.541
How dangerous?

15:18.375 --> 15:20.252
You know her better
than I do, but

15:20.961 --> 15:22.796
we both know she'll stop at nothing.

15:24.673 --> 15:25.507
It's true.

15:26.759 --> 15:28.802
And would this situation
be part of her scheme?

15:30.596 --> 15:34.266
To hopefully lure both of us
with him as bait?

15:35.392 --> 15:37.019
So I'm guessing you still don't like me.

15:37.102 --> 15:38.270
I don't know or trust you.

15:38.354 --> 15:40.564
If it weren't for me,
you would never have gotten out.

15:40.648 --> 15:43.484
I clearly remember you
stabbing me in the stomach once.

16:09.677 --> 16:10.594
He's so strong.

16:10.678 --> 16:13.847
He sent ten men flying across the room
when we tried to grapple him down.

16:13.931 --> 16:15.182
He's as strong as a bull.

16:15.265 --> 16:18.602
I had no choice but to taser the kid,
so I zapped him with my gun.

16:18.686 --> 16:20.396
Only then did he collapse.

16:21.438 --> 16:22.856
Look at him. Just look at him.

16:23.357 --> 16:24.817
You call that a person?

16:25.734 --> 16:26.568
Jong-hyeok.

16:30.322 --> 16:32.282
Hey, look at me. Ahn Jong-hyeok.

16:32.783 --> 16:35.119
What's wrong with you, huh?

16:36.161 --> 16:38.414
- What the…
- Captain, are you okay?

16:39.581 --> 16:40.749
You all right, sir?

16:42.459 --> 16:44.586
I'll bring over the first aid kit for you.

16:45.087 --> 16:46.255
Do you know each other?

16:50.509 --> 16:52.094
BUGANG COMPANY

16:55.681 --> 16:56.515
Yes, hello?

16:57.599 --> 16:59.101
It's me, Captain Yuh.

16:59.601 --> 17:01.603
Hey, you! Where are you right now?

17:02.229 --> 17:04.398
I'm still alive. Don't worry.

17:04.481 --> 17:06.692
So you're… back to this number again?

17:06.775 --> 17:07.776
And

17:09.278 --> 17:10.237
I remember.

17:12.364 --> 17:13.198
Oh.

17:14.116 --> 17:14.950
Okay.

17:15.034 --> 17:17.244
How about you fill me in
on what's going on?

17:18.787 --> 17:22.041
It's Jong-hyeok.
The Sinseol-dong lady's grandson.

17:22.124 --> 17:23.375
He was the suspect.

17:25.335 --> 17:27.171
He was recently hired at Jeonseung.

17:27.254 --> 17:28.088
Mm.

17:28.964 --> 17:30.007
Biotech.

17:35.679 --> 17:37.222
What the hell are you doing?

17:37.723 --> 17:39.808
You have no control
over your test subjects.

17:39.892 --> 17:43.020
The press is out there going
completely nuts over your mess.

17:48.692 --> 17:50.527
This was Seung-jo's doing, Chairman.

17:50.611 --> 17:52.196
And why would he do that?

17:54.156 --> 17:56.492
How about you ask
Lady Maeda that instead, sir?

17:57.076 --> 18:00.621
Are you saying Maeda is the one
responsible for all this?

18:08.212 --> 18:10.881
This is exactly why I warned you, Ji-oh.

18:17.179 --> 18:20.182
If you recall, I warned you
that Lady Maeda's plan would sink

18:20.265 --> 18:22.768
if you allowed her
to bring back Jang Tae-sang.

18:24.770 --> 18:28.440
Because of her foolishness, everyone here
at the company is compromised.

18:28.524 --> 18:29.566
If this reaches the public,

18:29.650 --> 18:32.027
Jeonseung Biotech
may not live to see another day.

18:37.241 --> 18:39.201
When your father
was the chairman of the company,

18:39.284 --> 18:41.703
he inserted the Najin in my head
with the sole intention

18:41.787 --> 18:44.248
that I continue devoting myself
to protecting Jeonseung

18:44.331 --> 18:45.499
as well as his work.

18:50.212 --> 18:54.007
If this whole fiasco continues to threaten
the welfare of your father's company,

18:55.259 --> 18:58.387
then know I will absolutely eliminate
any threat without mercy,

18:58.470 --> 19:01.306
whether that's Jang Tae-sang,
your incompetence, or even…

19:04.268 --> 19:05.811
Lady Maeda. Do you understand?

19:11.900 --> 19:12.901
Don't you forget.

19:13.902 --> 19:14.736
All right.

19:15.654 --> 19:17.531
First, let's clean up this mess.

19:18.574 --> 19:20.701
Number 71 needs to be retrieved.

19:21.243 --> 19:24.621
After that, we can talk with Lady Maeda.

19:25.330 --> 19:26.165
Sound good?

20:15.172 --> 20:16.340
What are you doing?

20:18.258 --> 20:19.718
Were you planning on going alone?

20:21.178 --> 20:22.304
Yeah, that's right.

20:23.472 --> 20:25.307
There's no way you're going
with those injuries.

20:25.390 --> 20:26.892
You haven't fully recovered.

20:33.065 --> 20:33.899
You see that?

20:35.400 --> 20:37.319
So let's go together since I'm healed.

20:38.153 --> 20:39.696
- Still a no.
- Master Jang.

20:39.780 --> 20:41.281
You're not going.

20:42.282 --> 20:44.243
I don't wanna see you
getting hurt anymore.

20:46.536 --> 20:49.414
If you go with me,
I won't be able to focus on the job.

20:49.498 --> 20:52.417
The last thing I want is for you
to be in danger all over again.

20:53.293 --> 20:54.294
I won't let that happen.

20:55.170 --> 20:56.838
It's the 21st century.

20:58.006 --> 21:00.092
Are you proposing
that whole old-fashioned thing

21:00.175 --> 21:02.261
where your role
is to protect the lady right now?

21:03.095 --> 21:04.096
Yes, I am.

21:05.555 --> 21:09.184
I know I don't look it, but I'm, like,
over a hundred years old by now.

21:09.268 --> 21:12.646
And I still have
an old-fashioned outlook on things.

21:12.729 --> 21:15.899
I think it is a man's job
to make sure he protects his woman.

21:17.609 --> 21:20.404
And I think
I'm a better fighter than you are.

21:20.487 --> 21:22.823
Mm… It's still a no.

21:22.906 --> 21:24.157
I'll have you know…

21:27.369 --> 21:28.370
I do not die.

21:30.914 --> 21:31.748
Also,

21:33.041 --> 21:35.919
as your woman,
I wanna do everything together.

21:38.171 --> 21:40.590
And not as someone
you have to always protect.

21:43.427 --> 21:44.511
From now on…

21:46.513 --> 21:48.682
I think we should just stick together.

21:51.977 --> 21:52.811
Hmm?

22:07.409 --> 22:08.994
You can't smile like that. It's cheating.

22:13.999 --> 22:16.501
Well, so, smile for me one more time.

22:39.775 --> 22:40.817
Uh-huh.

22:43.362 --> 22:45.155
Who are they? What's going on?

22:45.238 --> 22:47.783
Captain Yuh,
Jeonseung Biotech is waiting for you.

22:56.124 --> 22:58.335
Are you crazy?
Where do you think you're going?

22:58.418 --> 23:01.171
- To the station.
- And why the heck would you do that?

23:03.215 --> 23:04.049
I know the kid.

23:04.132 --> 23:05.217
Okay, so what?

23:05.967 --> 23:08.011
He's been arrested.
There's nothing you can do.

23:08.678 --> 23:10.764
Jeonseung won't let him stay in custody.

23:12.015 --> 23:14.935
They're gonna try and handle
the situation one of two ways.

23:15.018 --> 23:17.145
He'll either get taken back or get killed.

23:17.646 --> 23:20.190
If I don't take action,
then he will never see his grandma again.

23:20.273 --> 23:21.483
You never quit.

23:22.859 --> 23:23.860
When will you learn?

23:25.737 --> 23:29.241
You get beaten, attacked, tossed around,
and you barely survive it all.

23:29.741 --> 23:31.827
You can't win against them, so why fight?

23:32.661 --> 23:34.204
It's time you quit all this.

23:34.704 --> 23:36.415
This is a battle you can't win, Ho-jae.

23:37.416 --> 23:39.584
- Seung-jo.
- Go live your life instead!

23:40.085 --> 23:41.628
Run away with her. I don't care.

23:41.711 --> 23:44.047
Get ahead for once
while you still can. Huh?

23:46.716 --> 23:48.468
Seung-jo, I do wanna live my life.

23:49.386 --> 23:51.763
I wanna have a happy one with her.

23:53.014 --> 23:54.683
I won't get that by running away.

23:55.976 --> 23:58.895
If we have to keep running,
that's not a life worth living.

24:01.022 --> 24:02.149
So I have to do this.

24:09.906 --> 24:10.907
Yes, who's this?

24:10.991 --> 24:11.992
It's Detective Noh.

24:13.201 --> 24:15.829
Jeonseung Biotech
is trying to confiscate our guy.

24:16.455 --> 24:17.956
Their people are here already.

24:20.792 --> 24:22.043
Absolutely not.

24:22.127 --> 24:25.088
You come in here out of nowhere
and expect us to hand over the suspect?

24:25.172 --> 24:26.631
Well, the suspect has been infected.

24:26.715 --> 24:27.924
Infected with?

24:28.008 --> 24:29.551
I can't disclose that. It's classified.

24:30.635 --> 24:33.847
Your Violent Crimes Unit
inquired about this recently?

24:33.930 --> 24:37.350
Yes. And we haven't heard back
from Jeonseung Bio at all.

24:37.434 --> 24:39.603
This portable metal canister
is specifically used

24:39.686 --> 24:41.646
for precautionary measures. That's all.

24:41.730 --> 24:43.482
The nitrogen gas suppresses aggression.

24:44.065 --> 24:46.860
It seems people who are infected
can really act out.

24:47.736 --> 24:50.280
The KDCA has sent out an official notice.

24:51.072 --> 24:53.700
The National Police Agency
has approved the transfer.

24:54.493 --> 24:56.578
So please transfer
the infected prisoner to us.

24:56.661 --> 24:58.663
What exactly do you take the police for?

24:59.873 --> 25:01.875
This guy is a suspect
in a serial murder case.

25:01.958 --> 25:03.460
That's six victims in two months.

25:03.543 --> 25:04.461
And also,

25:05.170 --> 25:08.048
today, there were three victims
he attacked in the station.

25:08.131 --> 25:11.885
You all come in here waving this thing,
thinking you can just take him away.

25:24.231 --> 25:27.317
Guaranteeing the public's safety
is more important than your investigation,

25:27.400 --> 25:28.568
don't you agree?

25:28.652 --> 25:30.862
If an outbreak were
to spread uncontrollably,

25:30.946 --> 25:31.863
who'll be responsible?

25:31.947 --> 25:33.865
Will it be you, Captain?

25:40.997 --> 25:42.499
Jeonseung Biotech is already there.

25:42.582 --> 25:43.917
Well, then you're too late.

25:44.000 --> 25:46.753
The station's only ten minutes away.
We still got time.

25:46.836 --> 25:49.798
So what's your plan?
What are you gonna do?

25:50.382 --> 25:51.466
Do what I do best.

25:52.592 --> 25:53.426
Wreak havoc.

25:56.388 --> 25:58.265
All right, I'm ready. Let's go.

26:00.016 --> 26:00.850
I'll go too.

26:04.437 --> 26:05.689
We should stick together.

26:25.125 --> 26:28.128
Little fast, don't you think?
The speed limit's 50 kilometers.

26:28.211 --> 26:31.089
Who cares?
I never paid much attention to that.

26:37.887 --> 26:39.139
Does it check out?

26:39.222 --> 26:40.056
Yes.

26:40.140 --> 26:43.226
So I spoke with Disease Control,
and everything checks out.

26:43.310 --> 26:45.270
Apparently, around the country,
a handful of people

26:45.353 --> 26:47.814
are displaying symptoms
similar to the suspect in custody.

26:48.398 --> 26:51.651
In order to prevent a widespread outbreak,
it's being treated with tight security.

26:51.735 --> 26:55.822
And Jeonseung Biotech is currently
researching the origin of the outbreak.

26:55.905 --> 26:58.199
Captain, why are they

26:58.283 --> 27:00.327
covering the cameras up?

27:02.287 --> 27:03.496
Ah shit.

27:08.084 --> 27:09.628
Should I release the nitrogen gas?

27:09.711 --> 27:11.630
Don't bother. Just open the door.

29:19.591 --> 29:20.884
CAPTAIN YUH MYUNG-JUN

29:20.967 --> 29:22.218
Yes, Captain.

29:22.302 --> 29:23.553
Hey. Where are you?

29:25.513 --> 29:27.265
Hey, I asked where you were.

29:28.016 --> 29:30.018
Sir, I'm pursuing the Jeonseung Bio van.

29:31.519 --> 29:33.104
- What?
- Listen, I'm sorry.

29:33.188 --> 29:34.647
But something here still seems off,

29:34.731 --> 29:36.941
and I know that we're done
with the investigation

29:37.025 --> 29:39.235
'cause the killer was supposedly caught.

29:39.319 --> 29:41.654
And I'm aware
that you don't think I'm reliable, but

29:41.738 --> 29:44.449
I really need
to follow my instinct this time, Captain.

29:44.532 --> 29:45.450
So I'm sorry.

29:47.494 --> 29:48.703
You're working for once.

29:50.163 --> 29:52.081
Just don't lose sight
of the van, all right?

29:52.582 --> 29:54.375
And keep me updated on what you discover.

29:55.335 --> 29:57.378
Yep. Will do.
I'll get something for you, sir.

29:57.462 --> 29:59.047
Good work. That's all.

30:20.652 --> 30:22.278
Is he here, my grandson?

30:23.488 --> 30:24.531
Was he brought here?

30:25.240 --> 30:27.700
Just let… let me see him, please?
Can you do that?

30:29.285 --> 30:32.247
So, uh, he can't see anyone for now.

30:33.706 --> 30:34.958
He's innocent.

30:35.041 --> 30:36.167
He didn't do it.

30:36.251 --> 30:38.336
My Jong-hyeok isn't that kind of person.

30:38.920 --> 30:40.421
Captain, you know that.

30:40.505 --> 30:41.840
Yes, I, uh…

30:54.352 --> 30:56.646
Two cars and a motorcycle
are trailing us, sir.

30:57.605 --> 30:58.439
Then floor it.

31:11.953 --> 31:12.787
Huh?

31:37.061 --> 31:37.896
Ho-jae.

31:39.856 --> 31:40.857
How much do you like him?

31:45.695 --> 31:47.655
What makes you think
I'll tell you anything?

31:48.531 --> 31:49.782
Well, I like him a lot.

31:52.577 --> 31:54.746
I know about his history with Lady Maeda.

31:56.873 --> 31:57.874
So I understood

31:59.250 --> 32:01.377
why he was so furious toward Jeonseung.

32:03.463 --> 32:04.756
Last year, when he said

32:05.590 --> 32:07.800
he was going
to destroy all the laboratories…

32:10.803 --> 32:12.013
I knew without a doubt…

32:14.432 --> 32:16.309
that I'd be on his side till the end.

32:20.104 --> 32:21.189
At the time, I…

32:24.651 --> 32:27.070
really believed
I could lay my life down for him.

32:29.739 --> 32:30.740
However…

32:36.162 --> 32:37.163
that didn't happen.

32:40.166 --> 32:41.793
I didn't show up for him.

32:46.214 --> 32:47.507
I never told him why.

32:51.469 --> 32:53.304
Say that one more time.

32:55.807 --> 32:57.892
"I'd give my life for Master Jang"?

33:01.229 --> 33:02.689
Is that what I heard you say?

33:03.856 --> 33:06.067
He's the first person
ever to acknowledge me.

33:06.609 --> 33:07.819
He said that it was

33:09.320 --> 33:10.363
okay to be myself.

33:12.740 --> 33:14.450
He helped me realize

33:14.534 --> 33:16.244
that I am human as well.

33:18.621 --> 33:20.206
For the first time in my life…

33:22.875 --> 33:24.836
it wasn't painful to be alive.

33:25.920 --> 33:27.213
I have also

33:28.506 --> 33:29.590
acknowledged you too.

33:30.675 --> 33:34.345
I took you as my son, even though
you were born from a lowly courtesan.

33:35.471 --> 33:38.224
I bestowed upon you
the prestige of my family name.

33:40.059 --> 33:40.977
And yet,

33:42.270 --> 33:43.396
this betrayal.

33:45.440 --> 33:46.607
I'm sorry, Mother.

33:50.611 --> 33:51.738
Let me go to Ho-jae.

33:57.118 --> 33:58.369
Lift your head.

34:01.205 --> 34:02.999
I said lift your head up.

34:04.250 --> 34:05.084
Now.

34:14.802 --> 34:16.637
The Najin inside you

34:16.721 --> 34:19.223
will be in a deep sleep for 24 hours.

34:24.729 --> 34:28.274
It will not be able
to protect you anymore.

34:31.486 --> 34:34.572
If you are struck with a knife,
the wound will not heal.

34:34.655 --> 34:38.534
If you are shot with a gun,
you will bleed and die from your wound.

34:40.369 --> 34:42.663
Without the Najin, your body tissues…

34:44.707 --> 34:47.543
can no longer regenerate
from a fatal wound.

35:03.768 --> 35:05.478
Now you may be dismissed.

35:07.063 --> 35:08.689
Perhaps now you'll learn

35:09.398 --> 35:12.819
how weak and agonizing
the human body really is.

35:14.362 --> 35:16.697
And how meaningless the justice of man is,

35:17.949 --> 35:20.076
especially in the face of death.

35:24.956 --> 35:27.375
The choice is yours to make.

35:29.127 --> 35:30.461
I'll leave the door open.

36:15.798 --> 36:18.843
To tell you the truth,
I was there that day a year ago.

36:20.469 --> 36:23.431
But… there was no way for me to help him.

36:29.020 --> 36:30.229
I was scared

36:32.064 --> 36:33.232
that I might die.

36:37.778 --> 36:38.946
There's no shame…

36:41.032 --> 36:42.617
in being scared, you know?

36:45.828 --> 36:48.080
There are those who are afraid of dying…

36:54.170 --> 36:56.672
but there are also those
who are afraid to live.

37:03.221 --> 37:05.973
Each person experiences fear uniquely.

37:12.521 --> 37:16.234
From what I know,
Master Jang never questioned your loyalty.

37:20.196 --> 37:22.365
So that means he understands.

37:26.202 --> 37:27.662
So don't feel bad about it.

38:09.495 --> 38:10.830
You're vulnerable now.

38:12.248 --> 38:13.582
The Najin will be dormant

38:14.208 --> 38:15.293
for 24 hours.

38:15.835 --> 38:17.545
So if you're stabbed with a knife

38:18.963 --> 38:20.548
or shot point-blank with a gun…

38:22.591 --> 38:23.426
you will die.

38:23.509 --> 38:26.262
How could you? What'd you do to me?

38:27.680 --> 38:28.556
I told you.

38:30.850 --> 38:31.809
I have to do this.

38:36.897 --> 38:38.316
Otherwise, I might die.

39:17.938 --> 39:19.357
And so we meet again.

39:19.940 --> 39:20.775
So indeed.

39:21.484 --> 39:22.443
Has it been a year?

39:23.027 --> 39:25.154
I am tired of you and this mess.

39:26.947 --> 39:29.075
I've always been
quite persistent, remember?

39:29.158 --> 39:32.119
You finally find the woman
you've been waiting for all this time.

39:32.203 --> 39:34.038
Why bother showing your face here again?

39:34.121 --> 39:35.164
You have a death wish?

39:35.247 --> 39:36.374
Don't worry about it.

39:37.166 --> 39:39.710
Once I'm done with you,
I'll get back to living my life, okay?

39:41.087 --> 39:43.047
Don't tell me you still trust Seung-jo.

40:09.698 --> 40:10.533
Yeah.

40:12.034 --> 40:12.868
Of course.

40:16.038 --> 40:17.123
That poor girl, then.

40:21.335 --> 40:22.586
Let's get this over with.

40:37.059 --> 40:40.479
They lured Jang Tae-sang away,
and Seung-jo is with Ms. Yoon Chae-ok.

41:17.433 --> 41:18.267
Honey.

41:33.741 --> 41:34.575
My love.

41:35.993 --> 41:38.037
If I end up doing the surgery,

41:38.913 --> 41:41.373
do you think I'll be able
to play the cello again?

41:41.457 --> 41:42.374
Of course.

41:44.210 --> 41:46.670
You'll play even better
than before your accident.

41:47.421 --> 41:49.882
And when do you think
I'll be able to receive the transplant?

41:52.426 --> 41:55.095
I'm still searching
for the best one for you.

41:55.846 --> 42:00.059
After three to six months,
it learns most of the body mechanics,

42:00.142 --> 42:03.521
so it shouldn't put a huge toll
on the body after the transplant.

42:03.604 --> 42:07.191
And the success rate is higher than
when in a larval stage. Is that correct?

42:07.274 --> 42:09.068
Yes, we've had no fatalities

42:10.611 --> 42:12.321
with any mature Najin transplants.

42:19.161 --> 42:20.538
We'll go with this one.

42:21.747 --> 42:23.457
We'll implant it in three months.

42:25.125 --> 42:26.752
Just wait three more months.

42:28.796 --> 42:30.506
You'll be able to walk again soon.

42:31.131 --> 42:31.966
Enjoy your meal.

44:32.628 --> 44:36.799
♪ The day I saw the light ♪

44:37.508 --> 44:41.303
♪ You came into my life ♪

44:42.346 --> 44:48.602
♪ The black curtain started to lift ♪

44:52.022 --> 44:58.946
♪ Things happen
That you've never seen before ♪

44:59.530 --> 45:05.327
♪ Then I see the new feast of light ♪

45:05.411 --> 45:09.081
♪ Begin for me ♪

45:10.082 --> 45:14.962
♪ The Gradation in Light ♪

45:15.045 --> 45:19.299
♪ The Gradation in Light ♪

45:19.842 --> 45:23.429
♪ Inside of my heart ♪

45:23.512 --> 45:28.058
♪ Forgotten story, you and me ♪
